    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1066-a2">

                <pb facs="1158" n="1062" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1062"/>

                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">White</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">American Embassy, London:</hi></p>
                <p>Make suitable acknowledgment of telegraphic condolences on <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Maine</hi> disaster received from N. M. Rothschild &amp;
                    Sons and from Irish meeting, St. James Hall, James O’Kelly, chairman; also thank
                    Señor Garcia Meron, through Argentine legation, London, for his telegram dated
                    Southampton.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Day</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
